# DevMind — Root .env.example
#
# This file is an INDEX of all environment variables used across the monorepo.
# Each package has its own .env.example with the actual placeholders and comments.
#
# Layout:
#   client/.env.example      → Next.js client (Vercel Hobby)
#   server/.env.example      → FastAPI + Celery backend (Render free web service)
#   extension/.env.example   → VS Code extension (no secrets; uses SecretStorage)
#
# Rules:
#   - NEVER commit real keys, tokens or secrets to this repository.
#   - Rotate a key immediately if it is accidentally committed.
#   - Use `openssl rand -base64 32` to generate self-generated secrets.
#   - Variables marked [NEXT_PUBLIC_] are safe to expose to the browser.
#
# See docs/SETUP-GUIDE.md §7 for where to obtain each key and from which milestone.
